+
+### Recovering from XGrammar processing errors
+
+The XGrammar JSON-schema, regex, and CFG processor factories accept an optional
+`fallback_processor`. Normal calls use XGrammar exclusively. If XGrammar raises
+during processing, that same call and later calls use the fallback until
+`reset()` starts a fresh generation. Resetting also resets the fallback. When no
+fallback is configured, the original exception is propagated.
